---
description: Commerce mutations go through getCommerce only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commerce writes

Server actions under `app/(frontend)/**` that change carts, orders, quotes, or checkout state must call `getCommerce()` and must not call `payload.create`, `payload.update`, or `payload.delete` directly.

Staff order/quote changes belong in Payload hooks under `src/lib/orders` and `src/lib/quotes`, invoked from admin or commerce internals.
